ed.\n- **`queueSize(queueName)`** - Return the number of pending tasks in a specific queue.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Each named queue operates independently\n- Enqueueing to a queue that doesn't exist creates it\n- Dequeueing from a non-existent queue returns `null`\n- If no queue name is specified, use `'default'` as the queue name\n- `listQueues()` returns names of all queues that have been created\n- Queue-specific sizes are tracked independently\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n\nThe single-argument `enqueue(payload)` should still work by using the `'default'` queue.\nSimilarly, `dequeue()` with no arguments should dequeue from `'default'`.\n","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":25}}}
